  "keyFeatures": [
    "Persistent AI memory via .agents/brain/ Git artifacts — eliminates context decay between sessions",
    "Sovereign Markdown Palace — spatial memory architecture for organised AI recall",
    "Three-Pillar Model: AIOps (Mind) + GitOps (Record) + Ansible/Executor (Hand)",
    "Advisory Mode with Human-Approval-First — AI proposes, human approves, executor runs",
    "17 pre-built AI Agent Skills (dsom-bootstrap, dsom-project-cloner, okf-frontmatter-injector, etc.)",
    "Cross-platform: Linux/WSL2 shell scripts + Windows PowerShell equivalents for every tool",
    "Provider-agnostic: works with Gemini, Claude, Copilot, ChatGPT, and local LLMs",
    "Native OpenWiki Python emulator — zero Node.js dependency, 98%+ token cost reduction",
    "FastMCP Knowledge Server for Claude Desktop and Cursor integration",
    "OKF (Open Knowledge Format) v0.1 YAML frontmatter standard for all documentation",
    "Privacy Guardian — scans manifests for leaked IPs, keys, tokens before sharing",
    "Start-of-Day and End-of-Day ritual scripts for automated state sync and hibernation"
  ],
